nt></span></span></font></p><p><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2) 취업동아리 운영에 필요한 활동비 지원 및 행정적 지원</span></span></font></span></font></p><p><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 그 밖에 취업동아리 활성화를 위해 필요한 사항</span></span></font></span></span></font></p><p><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"></span>&nbsp;</font></p><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></span></font></span></span></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><font color=\"#6600ff\" face=\"한컴돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">** 취업동아리 지원사업 설명회 개최 **</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><font color=\"#6600ff\" face=\"한컴돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><strong><font color=\"#6600ff\"><font face=\"한컴돋움\">&nbsp;- </font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">일정: 2012.03.05(월) 13:00</span></font></span></font></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><strong><font color=\"#6600ff\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;- </span></font></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">장소: 본교 든사람교육센터(도서관211호)</span></font></span></font></font></strong></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"dotum\"><strong></strong></font></font></font>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"dotum\"><strong></strong></font></font></font>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"dotum\"><strong>&nbsp;▣ 취업동아리 신청요건<br><!--StartFragment--></strong><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\"><strong>○ 취업동아리 구성요건<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\">1) 본교 재적생 5명이상으로 회원이 구성되어야&nbsp;함.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\">2) 취업 및 진로와 관련하여 뚜렷한 목적성이 있어야&nbsp;함.<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\"><strong>&nbsp; ○ 취업동아리 구성분야<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\">1) 특정기업 및 그룹사의 진출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\">2)&nbsp;특정 업.직종의 진출<br></font></span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 기타 취업과 관련된 분야<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"dotum\"><br></font></span>&nbsp;&nbs